%% Organization lifecycle transitions from platform controls
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PROVISIONING: create organization

    PROVISIONING --> ACTIVE: all provisioning steps pass
    PROVISIONING --> PROVISIONING_FAILED: step fails
    PROVISIONING_FAILED --> PROVISIONING: retry or resume run

    ACTIVE --> SUSPENDED: operator or subscription policy
    SUSPENDED --> ACTIVE: reactivate after resolution
    ACTIVE --> CLOSURE_PENDING: initiate closure
    SUSPENDED --> CLOSURE_PENDING: initiate closure

    CLOSURE_PENDING --> CLOSED: retention and finalization pass
    CLOSURE_PENDING --> ARCHIVED: archive policy
    CLOSURE_PENDING --> SUSPENDED: closure cancelled
    CLOSED --> ARCHIVED: archive closed tenant

    ARCHIVED --> [*]

    note right of PROVISIONING
      Host resolution must not
      serve the tenant yet.
    end note

    note right of ACTIVE
      Domain can resolve when
      database registry is READY.
    end note

    note right of SUSPENDED
      Browsing may remain allowed;
      commerce writes are blocked.
    end note

    note right of CLOSURE_PENDING
      Restrict tenant traffic and
      preserve retention evidence.
    end note
